+# @akashic/codex-app-server-adapter
+
+Backend-neutral Akashic `RunAgentTurn` adapter for the official Codex App Server.
+It uses JSONL over stdio and deliberately does not expose App Server directly to
+the network.
+
+The live certificate performs the official lifecycle:
+
+```text
+initialize -> initialized -> model/list -> thread/start
+-> turn/start #1 -> turn/completed
+-> turn/start #2 on the same thread -> turn/completed
+```
+
+Protocol types are not frozen by hand. The live harness generates the JSON
+Schema bundle from the exact installed Codex binary and stores its digest beside
+the evidence.
